msgstr "Cargo stop can not be used by passenger vehicles"

msgid "Graphics Preference"
msgstr "Graphics mode"

msgid "MODIO_INFO"
msgstr ""
"Mod.io is Urban Games recommended mod browser for Transport Fever 2 and "
"allows all PC users (not just Steam users) as well as the users of "
"PlayStation®5 and Xbox Series X|S to download both, asset and script mods "
"for Transport Fever 2.\n"
"\n"
"In order to make them available to the large console and non-steam user "
"community, mod creators have to specifically upload their mods to mod.io "
"which can easily be done through the in-game mod-publishing tool. Mods from "
"mod.io can directly be downloaded, installed and are automatically updated "
"using our in-game mod browser. A big thank you to all modders for your "
"contribution."

msgid "MODIO_INFO_CONSOLE"
msgstr ""
"Mod.io is Urban Games recommended mod browser for Transport Fever 2.\n"
"\n"
"Mods from mod.io can directly be downloaded, installed and are automatically "
"updated using our in-game mod browser. A big thank you to all modders for "
"your contribution."

